ton class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full font-medium transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-primary focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none border-2 border-brand-primary text-brand-primary hover:bg-brand-primary hover:text-white h-14 px-10 text-lg\">Contact Us Today</button></div></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-10 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex flex-col items-center gap-2 animate-bounce pointer-events-auto\"><span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-brand-secondary tracking-widest uppercase\">Scroll to explore</span><div class=\"w-1 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-primary/30 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1/2 bg-brand-primary animate-pulse rounded-full\"></div></div></div></section><section class=\"relative w-full h-[600vh] bg-brand-light\"><div class=\"sticky top-0 left-0 w-full h-screen overflow-hidden pointer-events-none z-0\"><div style=\"position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;pointer-events:auto\"><div style=\"width:100%;height:100%\"><canvas style=\"display:block\"></canvas></div></div></div><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-10 text-brand-dark flex flex-col justify-between py-[50vh]\"><div class=\"h-screen flex items-center justify-start px-10 md:px-24\"><div class=\"max-w-md space-y-4 bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-md p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-white/40\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-brand-primary\">The Beginning</h2><p class=\"text-lg\">Every successful poultry farm starts with premium quality eggs. We source only the best layers to ensure high hatchability.</p></div></div><div class=\"h-screen flex items-center justify-end px-10 md:px-24\"><div class=\"max-w-md space-y-4 bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-md p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-white/40\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-brand-primary\">A New Life</h2><p class=\"text-lg\">Our 1-day old chicks are healthy, vaccinated, and carefully transported. The perfect start for your growing flock.</p></div></div><div class=\"h-screen flex items-center justify-start px-10 md:px-24\"><div class=\"max-w-md space-y-4 bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-md p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-white/40\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-brand-primary\">Optimal Nutrition</h2><p class=\"text-lg\">We provide high-grade poultry feed mapped to every growth stage, ensuring steady, healthy growth and strong immunity.</p></div></div><div class=\"h-screen flex items-center justify-end px-10 md:px-24\"><div class=\"max-w-md space-y-4 bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-md p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-white/40\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-brand-primary\">Strong &amp; Healthy</h2><p class=\"text-lg\">With the right environment and our expert farming guidance, your birds grow resilient, hitting optimal weights quickly.</p></div></div><div class=\"h-screen flex items-center justify-start px-10 md:px-24\"><div class=\"max-w-md space-y-4 bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-md p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-white/40\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-brand-primary\">Premium Desi Chicken</h2><p class=\"text-lg\">Fully grown, top-quality desi chickens ready for the market. CC Agro provides trusted trading you can count on.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-24 px-6 bg-white w-full\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16 space-y-4\"><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-brand-dark\">Our Products &amp; Services</h2><p class=\"text-lg text-brand-dark/70 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Everything you need for a successful poultry business, from premium birds to expert consultation.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"p-8 rounded-3xl bg-brand-light border border-brand-primary/10 hover:border-brand-primary/30 transition-colors shadow-sm hover:shadow-md group\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-white flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-sm group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-8 h-8 text-brand-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-brand-dark mb-3\">Desi Chicken</h3><p class=\"text-brand-dark/70 leading-relaxed\">High-quality, farm-raised desi chickens for commercial trading.</p></div><div class=\"p-8 rounded-3xl bg-brand-light border border-brand-primary/10 hover:border-brand-primary/30 transition-colors shadow-sm hover:shadow-md group\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-white flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-sm group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-egg w-8 h-8 text-brand-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2C8 2 4 8 4 14a8 8 0 0 0 16 0c0-6-4-12-8-12\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-brand-dark mb-3\">1 Day Old Chicks</h3><p class=\"text-brand-dark/70 leading-relaxed\">Healthy, vaccinated day-old chicks to start your flock.</p></div><div class=\"p-8 rounded-3xl bg-brand-light border border-brand-primary/10 hover:border-brand-primary/30 transition-colors shadow-sm hover:shadow-md group\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-white flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-sm group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check w-